  "body": "## What's Changed\n* perf: optimize Rust verification reuse and release build by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/366\n* docs: promote WI-402 terminal records by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/368\n* chore: archive WI-404 after reviewed merge by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/369\n* fix: align closed documentation promotion by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/371\n* fix: reconcile failed Work Item artifacts by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/370\n* feat: make knowledge projections explicit and repository-local by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/372\n* fix: keep work-item inspect read-only by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/373\n* release: prepare v0.2.41 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/374\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/compare/v0.2.40...v0.2.41",
